    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":5}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":347,\"yPos\":589},\"ID\":4,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Only
    3..? I thought there were supposed to be 9 layers in Hell.\",\"parentUIDs\":[3],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":6}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":331,\"yPos\":728},\"ID\":5,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Well
    of course ! But even one as twisted as you can\u2019t compare to what lurks below.\",\"parentUIDs\":[4],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":7}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":339,\"yPos\":863},\"ID\":6,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You\u2019ll
    need to find your own way, dear; but beware. Down here no one is your friend.\\r\\n\",\"parentUIDs\":[5],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
